# codebase-memory-mcp indexing rules (fork-owned; gitignore syntax, see
# https://github.com/DeusData/codebase-memory-mcp/blob/main/docs/cbmignore.md)

# The built-in skip list drops every directory named "tools" or "scripts". Here that
# hides openpilot/tools/ (dgx, shadow, fair, stonesoup, upstream_sync), which is most of
# the fork's own code, the root tools/ helpers, and the fork's coverage/lint scripts/.
!tools/
!scripts/
